<title>HUNGARY: STYL REPORTS RISING 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</title>
<headline>STYL REPORTS RISING 1996 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>			 Jan-Dec 1996     1996 results as percentage </p>
<p>							of 1995 figures (*)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    435.2	     99.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		342.1	    113.4</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue	 2,938.0	    101.6</p>
<p>    Other revenue		 145.7	     99.6</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales   1,255.3	     90.2</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales 1,181.6	    121.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  211.6	     90.2</p>
<p>    Net financial income	135.9 loss     100.1</p>
<p>	 Financial revenue	140.2	    139.4</p>
<p>	 Financial expenditure  276.1	    116.8</p>
<p>    Extraordinary income	 42.7 (*)</p>
<p>NOTE - Styl Ruhagyar Rt is a garment factory.</p>
<p>The company said that 38.8 million forints of the total</p>
<p>42.7 million extraordinary income stemmed from a 40 percent</p>
<p>tax allowance for 1995 that the company received at the end of</p>
<p>1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
